@startuml failover-flow
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0F19
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #38BDF8
    ActorBorderColor #38BDF8
    LifeLineBorderColor #818CF8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #1E293B
    ParticipantBorderColor #A855F7
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #1E293B
    ParticipantFontColor #F8FAFC
}

autonumber
participant "Payment Service\n(Active Worker)" as App #10B981
participant "PgBouncer\n(Pool Router)" as PB #38BDF8
participant "Patroni Cluster Mgr\n(DCS / Raft / etcd)" as Patroni #F59E0B
participant "PostgreSQL Shard 1\nPrimary (AZ-a) [FAILS]" as DB_Pri #EF4444
participant "PostgreSQL Shard 1\nStandby (AZ-b) [NEW PRI]" as DB_Sec #10B981
participant "Prometheus / Alertmanager" as Alert #EC4899

== 1. Failure Event & Heartbeat Timeout ==
DB_Pri -[#EF4444]>x DB_Pri: Hardware Failure / Kernel Panic / AZ Crash
App -> PB: Execute OCC Balance Write
PB -> DB_Pri: TCP Query -> Connection Refused / Timeout
activate PB
PB --> App: SQL Exception: Connection Failed (500)
deactivate PB

Patroni -> DB_Pri: Health Check Heartbeat (Interval: 2s)
note right of Patroni: Heartbeat fails (3 missed = 6s total)
Patroni -> Patroni: Declare Primary Unhealthy & Revoke Leader Lease

== 2. Leader Election & DCS Promotion (< 10 seconds) ==
Patroni -> DB_Sec: Evaluate Replication Lag (LSN Check)
DB_Sec --> Patroni: LSN matched with synchronous WAL stream (Zero Lag)
Patroni -> Patroni: Acquire Leader Lock in Raft DCS for Standby AZ-b
Patroni -> DB_Sec: Execute pg_promote()
activate DB_Sec
DB_Sec --> Patroni: Promoted to READ-WRITE Primary
deactivate DB_Sec

== 3. Dynamic Connection Pool Rewiring ==
Patroni -> PB: Trigger Reload / Update Host Endpoint (AZ-b:5432)
activate PB
PB -> PB: Drain old failed connections & redirect active pool to New Primary
PB --> Patroni: Rewiring Complete (Total Failover Time: 12.4s <= 30s RTO)
deactivate PB

== 4. Application Retry & Self-Healing ==
App -> App: Jittered Retry #1 on OCC Balance Write
App -> PB: Execute OCC Balance Write
PB -> DB_Sec: UPDATE accounts SET available_balance = available_balance - :amt WHERE account_id = :id
activate DB_Sec
DB_Sec --> PB: 1 row updated (Commit Success)
deactivate DB_Sec
PB --> App: Transaction Committed (Zero Data Loss - RPO = 0)

== 5. Telemetry & Post-Incident State ==
Patroni -> Alert: Emit P1 Alert: Primary Shard 1 Failed over to Standby AZ-b
Alert -> Alert: Log RTO Metrics (12.4s) & Auto-provision replacement replica in AZ-c
@enduml
